Cyberpunk style: A sprawling futuristic Chennai cityscape at dusk, with towering glass skyscrapers reflecting neon magenta and electric blue lights. In the foreground, streams of holographic data particles flow upward like digital monsoon rain, representing rapid growth and movement. Silhouettes of countless workers move along elevated walkways and transit tubes connecting the buildings, suggesting constant motion and expansion. The architecture blends traditional South Indian temple gopuram shapes with sleek chrome and glass structures. Flying vehicles streak across an amber-tinted sky filled with floating corporate platforms. The scene conveys both the excitement and chaos of explosive growth—buildings literally under construction with robotic cranes, new floors materializing from glowing wireframes. The mood is electric, ambitious, slightly overwhelming, capturing the tension between opportunity and the strain of managing rapid transformation.
